<title>UK: Alliance &amp; Leicester names deputy chairman.</title>
<headline>Alliance &amp; Leicester names deputy chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Alliance &amp; Leicester Building Society, which is due to be floated on the stock exchange later this year, said it has appointed John Baden a deputy chairman alongside Sir Michael Thompson.</p>
<p>This follows the retirement of Niall Crowley who is leaving in April.</p>
<p>Baden joined the Alliance board in 1990 when chief executive of Girobank of which he is still deputy chairman.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
